    "For this, Pingscape asks two services on the internet: ipify (ipify.org) for your public IP address, and RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) for the provider and organization. Each of them sees your public IP address, as with any request, and nothing else is sent. There is no server of ours. You can change this at any time under About.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dafür fragt Pingscape zwei Dienste im Internet: ipify (ipify.org) nach deiner öffentlichen IP-Adresse und RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) nach Provider und Organisation. Beide sehen deine öffentliche IP-Adresse, wie bei jeder Anfrage, sonst wird nichts gesendet. Einen Server von uns gibt es nicht. Ändern kannst du das jederzeit unter Über."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For this, Pingscape asks two services on the internet: ipify (ipify.org) for your public IP address, and RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) for the provider and organization. Each of them sees your public IP address, as with any request, and nothing else is sent. There is no server of ours. You can change this at any time under About."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para ello, Pingscape consulta dos servicios de internet: ipify (ipify.org) para tu dirección IP pública y RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) para el proveedor y la organización. Cada uno ve tu dirección IP pública, como en cualquier petición, y no se envía nada más. No tenemos servidor propio. Puedes cambiarlo en cualquier momento en Acerca de."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour cela, Pingscape interroge deux services sur Internet : ipify (ipify.org) pour votre adresse IP publique et RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) pour le fournisseur et l’organisation. Chacun voit votre adresse IP publique, comme pour toute requête, et rien d’autre n’est envoyé. Nous n’avons pas de serveur. Vous pouvez modifier ce choix à tout moment dans À propos."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per questo Pingscape interroga due servizi su Internet: ipify (ipify.org) per il tuo indirizzo IP pubblico e RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) per il provider e l’organizzazione. Ciascuno vede il tuo indirizzo IP pubblico, come per qualsiasi richiesta, e non viene inviato altro. Non abbiamo un server nostro. Puoi cambiare questa scelta in qualsiasi momento in Info."
          }
        }
      }
    },
